<title>USA: MTS Systems gets $4.7 million order.</title>
<headline>MTS Systems gets $4.7 million order.</headline>
<dateline>EDEN PRAIRIE, Minn. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>MTS Systems Corp said Tuesday it won a $4.7 million contract from the French Ministry of Defense to build a dual-flap wave generator for the Bassin d'Essais des Carenes in Val de Reuil, France.</p>
<p>The wave generator system will be able to generate regular and random sea states. It will be used by the French Navy to carry out hydrodynamic studies for both civilian and defense vessels.</p>
<p>MTS Systems manufactures computer-based testing and simulation systems.</p>
<p>	  ((Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
